# K114s r3c kernel (docs/r3c-kernel.md): our K114s series on betizzel/omarchy-m5's v272-18 kernel (release line after
# omarchy-j714s-9), plus the light sensor and NVRAM patches.
#
# Base, built exactly as the recipe builds it: aurora-silicon/linux 677be395b9d2 (integration/aurora) +
#   installer/recipes/linux-aurora-j714s linux-j714s-27.2.patch at betizzel/omarchy-m5 1bc6e1523b (pkgrel 18;
#   patches/j714s-27.2/linux 0001-0021 applied one by one with `git am --3way` give the same git tree, f401b56bd5db).
# Then:
#   1. localversion.10-pkgrel   -17.v272-18-k114s-r3c   (release 7.3.0-17.v272-18-k114s-r3c-ARCH)
#   2. the patches below, with `git am --3way`, in this order
#   3. configuration: betizzel's v272-18 config + patches/linux/config/k114s-r3.config, then olddefconfig
# Package: linux-k114s 7.3.0.r3c-1 (K114S_CAND=r3c): it takes the r3a slot (r3a retired, owner's decision 2026-11-17).
#
# 1. from r3b.c4, unchanged (they apply as they are)
